WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
- [Hurts:] In the great before,

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.125
the average hot and extremely athletic man

00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:05.125
could win MVP or a Super Bowl.

00:00:05.125 --> 00:00:07.875
But now there is only Mahomes.

00:00:07.875 --> 00:00:09.875
This year will be different.

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:11.375
Hey, is this MVP race?

00:00:11.375 --> 00:00:13.500
I think I'm going to make a push

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.375
- Woo! Motor city lookin' MOTOR GRITTY.

00:00:18.375 --> 00:00:20.500
- [Goff:] Coach, I don't think we quite fit in.

00:00:21.375 --> 00:00:22.625
- [Lamar:] DADDY'S GOT A NEW SYSTEM.

00:00:23.125 --> 00:00:24.500
Take THAT haters.

00:00:24.875 --> 00:00:26.250
- [Mahomes/Hurts:] No one's really hating on you anymore.

00:00:26.625 --> 00:00:29.000
- The lack of haters are my new haters!

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:30.375
Time to run it back!

00:00:30.375 --> 00:00:32.750
- Indeed, it is time for a running back.

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.625
- I didn't say...

00:00:34.625 --> 00:00:36.250
the ultimate system QB.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.000
- Oh, what a lovely play!

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:41.750
- Careful, trap games ahead!

00:00:43.875 --> 00:00:44.875
- [Hurts:] HA! Uh oh.

00:00:46.875 --> 00:00:49.500
- [Tua:] Ha! We only let ourselves get stopped by good teams.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.250
OH NO, GOOD TEAMS! 

00:00:51.625 --> 00:00:52.500
Hurry up, hurry up!

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:53.500
Uh, uh, uh.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.000
- Ok Josh, just don't get distracted-

00:00:56.125 --> 00:00:57.750
Oh GOSH, A DEFENDER!

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:00.625
I really got to stop these turnovers.

00:01:00.875 --> 00:01:03.750
- That’s right. This year a defender has a chance!

00:01:04.125 --> 00:01:06.250
Oh damn bro, I'm a mirage.

00:01:07.875 --> 00:01:09.500
- [Mahomes:] Huh? What’s that?

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.375
- [chanting men:] CJ STROUD. CJ STROUD.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.375
- BEHOLD! COLERIDGE BERNARD STROUD THE 4TH!

00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:21.250
- Time to use my only weapon!

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:23.750
- Nah, shorty, you hang up first.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.500
- Ok, time to lean on the defense.

00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:28.000
- This is for last year!

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.250
- You gotta be more specific.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:31.625
I beat a LOT of teams last year.

00:01:31.875 --> 00:01:32.625
- [Mahomes/Hurts:] AHHH!

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:34.375
- [All:] I WILL WIN MVP!

00:01:34.375 --> 00:01:35.625
- I will not.

00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:40.000
- Just get me to mid-December.

00:01:40.458 --> 00:01:42.208
- I'm trying my best.

00:01:42.208 --> 00:01:47.208
- Oh, classic mainstream media
making the post-episode tag about us.

00:01:47.375 --> 00:01:50.041
And not how much the f--king Giants suck.

